Firmware modules. PlatformIO builds each folder here as its own library.

  common/     Device base class, clock
  transport/  CAN bus (I2C/UART use Arduino's own classes)
  board/      peripherals + pins per board revision, connector structs
  imu/  lidar/  power/  motor/
              abstract class at the top of the folder,
              implementations in subfolders (dummy/ today)

See ../README.md for how implementations are constructed and swapped.
